INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('fyuuki0jp/SourceDoc/plan-adr-flow', 'plan-adr-flow', 'fyuuki0jp', 'SourceDoc', 'community', 'plan-adr-flow fyuuki0jp SourceDoc community The plan-adr-flow skill analyzes source code to generate documentation, benefiting developers by keeping task planning and technical decisions organized in PLAN.md and docs/ADR/ files. Plan-ADR-Flow 是一种自动化任务规划和技术决策文档化的技术，通过创建 PLAN.md 和 docs/ADR/ 文件实现开发过程的透明度 Plan-ADR-Flow はタスクプランニングと技術的意思決定を自動化ドキュメント化する技術で、PLAN.md と docs/ADR/ ファイルを作成して開発プロセスの透明性を実現する Plan-ADR-Flow는 태스크 계획 및 기술적 의사결정을 자동화 문서화하는 기술로, PLAN.md 및 docs/ADR/ 파일을 생성하여 개발 프로세스의 투명성을 실현합니다 plan-adr-flow es un flujo de trabajo que analiza el código fuente y crea documentación técnica. Ayuda a mantener la planificación de tareas y decisiones técnicas documentadas. plan-adr-flow est un flux de travail qui analyse le code source et crée une documentation technique. Il aide à maintenir la planification des tâches et les décisions techniques documentées. plan-adr-flow ist ein Arbeitsablauf, der den Quellcode analysiert und technische Dokumentation erstellt. Er hilft dabei, die Aufgabenplanung und technische Entscheidungen zu dokumentieren. O plan-adr-flow é uma ferramenta que analisa o código-fonte e cria documentação técnica de alta qualidade, melhorando a colaboração e a tomada de decisões plan-adr-flow - это инструмент, который анализирует исходный код и создает техническую документацию высокого качества, улучшая сотрудничество и принятие решений تدفق plan-adr هو أداة تحليل الشفرة المصدرية وإنشاء توثيق تقني عالي الجودة، مما يحسن التعاون وعمليات اتخاذ القرارات how to use plan-adr-flow plan-adr-flow setup guide plan-adr-flow alternative plan-adr-flow vs traditional planning methods what is plan-adr-flow plan-adr-flow install plan-adr-flow workflow automation technical planning with plan-adr-flow ADR file management with plan-adr-flow Plan-ADR-Flow AIエージェント 任务规划 技术决策 文档化 自动化 开发效率 PLAN.md docs/ADR/ Creates or replaces PLAN.md at repo root with implementation plans Drafts plans and confirms with users before implementation for decomposable tasks Tries task size to determine if PLAN.md or ADR creation is necessary Documents technical decisions in docs/ADR/ files before, during, and after implementation Supports workflow automation for task planning and technical decision documentation plan-adr-flow is a technical planning skill that automates documentation creation for tasks and technical decisions using PLAN.md and ADR files.');
