INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('Joseph-VJ/XAI-Threat-Attribution-IDS/feature-validator', 'feature-validator', 'Joseph-VJ', 'XAI-Threat-Attribution-IDS', 'community', 'feature-validator Joseph-VJ XAI-Threat-Attribution-IDS community The feature-validator skill ensures all features align with documented business requirements, benefiting developers and product managers. It references core business documents like BRD, FRD, and PRD. Feature Validator 是一个确保功能与业务需求一致的工具，通过检查核心业务文档 Feature Validator は機能とビジネス要件を一致させるツールです。核心ビジネス文書をチェックします Feature Validator는 기능과 비즈니스 요구사항을 일치시키는 도구로, 핵심 비즈니스 문서를 확인합니다 feature-validator garantiza que las características se alineen con los requisitos comerciales documentados, como BRD, FRD y PRD feature-validator assure que les fonctionnalités sont alignées sur les exigences commerciales documentées, telles que BRD, FRD et PRD feature-validator stellt sicher, dass Funktionen mit den dokumentierten Geschäftsanforderungen, wie BRD, FRD und PRD, übereinstimmen O feature-validator é uma ferramenta que garante a conformidade com os documentos de requisitos de negócios. Ele verifica a alinhamento dos recursos com os requisitos documentados. Feature-validator - это инструмент, обеспечивающий соответствие требованиям бизнеса. Он проверяет соответствие функций документированным требованиям. feature-validator هو أداة تضمن مطابقة متطلبات الأعمال. يتحقق من مطابقة الميزات للمتطلبات المُوثقة. how to use feature-validator what is feature-validator feature-validator setup guide feature-validator alternative feature-validator vs requirements management tools feature-validator install business requirements document validation feature alignment best practices technical skill for product managers streamlining development process with feature-validator Feature Validator AI 工具 业务需求 功能验证 核心业务文档 BRD FRD MRD PRD SRS References core business documents including BRD, FRD, MRD, PRD, SRS, and BUSINESS Validates feature alignment with documented business requirements Supports multiple document formats including Markdown (.md) files Ensures compliance with market, product, and software specifications Streamlines development process by checking core business docs Facilitates collaboration between developers, product managers, and business stakeholders feature-validator is a technical skill that validates feature alignment with business requirements documents such as BRD, FRD, and PRD');
